The blocking method (GUIDE.md, scripts/ and references/) is an adaptation of
seedance-blocking by Thomas Lundström / Grove Media, under the MIT License
(full text in LICENSE).

Kept almost unchanged: scripts/solve_shot.py, scripts/previz_core.py,
references/CAMERA_RULES.md, references/SHOT_GRAMMAR.md and
references/SEEDANCE_PROMPT.md.

Changes in this version: runs through the local Blender Bridge (any MCP client)
instead of the Higgsfield Bridge connector; viewport_ready() and backup() adapted
to run on the Bridge timer and on Windows; local delivery through EasyComfee's
3D render -> Video (LTX 2.5); GUIDE.md rewritten and served by the MCP server
(blocking_guide), with the solver and the core loader exposed as MCP tools.
